# Build context exclusions for reg_webapp/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# CI builds from a sparse checkout that holds only what the Dockerfile COPYs; this
# file matters for a local `fly deploy .`, which sends the working tree. Any DB or
# archive lying around the tree must never enter the image: the bake stage fetches
# the release DBs at build time.

# --- Local DB artifacts (the image bakes its own from the release) ---
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.zst

# --- VCS / build cruft ---
.git/
target/
**/.DS_Store
